Scope note. This licence covers the code, documentation and site in this
repository. It does not cover data that is not in the repository: the
enrollment histories that `make backfill` retrieves from Berkeleytime
(https://berkeleytime.com) are Berkeleytime's and are neither committed nor
redistributed here; the snapshots this project's own scraper records on the
`data` branch are aggregate public counts from classes.berkeley.edu.
